o you when you talk, nods or waves, and answers out loud. Pick one of five characters, choose from 30 voices and describe its personality in your own words.\n\nUse it at home to set up a new appliance, learn a hobby tool or fix something. Use it at work on equipment you don't touch every day.\n\nRequires an internet connection, and permission to use the microphone and the headset's cameras.", "short_description": "Your AI sidekick in mixed reality. It sees what you see and walks you through real tasks, hands-free."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://junixr.com/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Presence AI, Inc.", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://junixr.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1063584910766706"}, {"id": "1043107547362485"}, {"id": "514087707868786"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING", "OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1329798096894707"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "989353910189847"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "989353910189847"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1793644440, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "989353910189847"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1339801312561052", "version": "0.1.0"}, "id": "990009240079064", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1306709352536915", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1339801312561052"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "990009240079064"}]}, "change_log": "What's new\r\n\r\n\u2022 Drop your Character anywhere. Let go near a floor, couch or table and it settles onto it; let go in mid-air and it floats right where you left it. No more Characters disappearing under the floor in spots the headset can't see, like right in front of a couch.\r\n\u2022 Lost your Character? Ask \"Where are you?\" and an arrow points you to it, while your Character tells you where it is.\r\n\u2022 Say \"Show yourself\" and your Character appears in front of you at eye level, where you can see it.\r\n\u2022 Your Character knows it has a face and a body, and says so.\r\n\u2022 Spatial AI is clearer about what it's for: hands-on jobs like tidying a room, getting an appliance going or fixing something. It helps with the physical parts of a phone, like its buttons and ports, but not with the apps on the screen.\r\n\u2022 Faster answers when your Character takes a look at something.", "created_date": 1793774082, "id": "1339801312561052", "version": "0.1.0", "version_code": 1199, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1306709352536915", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1339801312561052"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"no